{
 "encounter_id": "00572",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Quarmby, I've got your GP's letter here, and the notes from when you came in a fortnight ago. The letter says blood in your urine. Tell me about it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Well, it's the blood in my wee, doctor. First time, I thought it was beetroot, but I hadn't had any."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fair. What colour exactly? Pink, red, tea-coloured?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sort of reddy-pink, like weak squash. Comes and goes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how long has it been happening?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About three weeks now. Off and on. Some days it's clear, some days it isn't."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it hurt when you pass it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no pain at all. That's what's odd. Doesn't hurt a bit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain in your back or sides? Or a temperature?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nothing in the back. And no temperature, I'd know, the wife checks me like a Sunday roast."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Anything else you've noticed lately, even if it seems unrelated?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm up in the night for a wee, three times, that's new. And I'm dog-tired by teatime."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else? Appetite, weight, swelling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've gone off my grub a bit. And my ankles are like balloons by evening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mm-hm. Right. Do you have any long-term conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Diabetes, type 2, about eight years. And high blood pressure, longer than that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gallbladder out in 2015, and a knee replacement about six years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Has anyone in the family had kidney or bladder trouble?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My dad had bladder cancer. He was in his seventies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, that's useful to know. Now, tell me what tablets you take."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day, for the blood pressure. Then metformin for the sugar, 500 milligrams twice a day. And atorvastatin for the cholesterol, 20 milligrams at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And do you take them all regularly?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Every day, religiously. Well, the evening metformin I do miss now and then, if I've dozed off in the chair. I couldn't swear I get it right every day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's common, and we'll tackle it another time. Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Codeine. Came out in an itchy rash all over, years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Do you smoke, or have you ever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I did, twenty a day. Packed it in in 2010, the best thing I ever did."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Well done. And what was your work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lorry driver, forty years on the road. Retired now, and the wife says I'm under her feet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ha. How are your bowels?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine, regular as the 7.15 bus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. And is the sleep disturbed by the night trips, or do you drop off again?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Drop off like a stone, the minute I'm back in bed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good, thank you. Let's do your checks. I'll take your pressure, pulse, temperature, oxygen and weight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need to take my shoes off for the scales?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes please, and your jacket."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure is 148 over 88, pulse 78, temperature 36.9 degrees, oxygen 97 percent, and weight 84 kilograms.",
   "pause": 18
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all right? I've lost a bit, I think."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your pressure's a little up. We'll come to that. Lie back and let me feel your tummy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. Mind, I'm ticklish."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll be quick. Tell me if anything is tender."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Only that your hands are cold, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is soft. Now your ankles. There is swelling around both ankles, and it leaves a dent when I press.",
   "pause": 12
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I told the wife. Balloons."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, let me be direct. Blood in the urine without pain needs proper checking. I can't rule out a growth in the bladder or kidney yet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A growth? You mean cancer?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's one of the possibilities, and I'd rather say so plainly. It could equally be something simpler, so we find out properly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Well. I didn't expect that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Understood, and it's a lot to take in. Shall I go on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, go on. What happens now, then?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Four things. One, a urine sample today. Two, blood tests to check how your kidneys are working. Three, an ultrasound scan of your kidneys and bladder. Four, a camera test of the bladder, a cystoscopy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A camera? Down there? Oh, lovely."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's quick and done with numbing gel. I'll arrange all four, and the scan and camera appointments will come by post."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need to stop my tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, carry on with all three as normal. Try not to miss the evening metformin, put the tablets by the kettle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "By the kettle. Good idea, I'm always in there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you in two weeks, once the results are back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. I'll tell the wife, she'll want to come."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please bring her. And drink plenty of water meanwhile."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will do. Thanks, doctor, you've been straight with me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Best way. See you in a fortnight, Mr Quarmby."
  }
 ],
